      "writtenOn": "2024-12-06T21:51:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC, if you have a plugin `foo` providing an operand `bar` here, the syntax for using it in a copyCondition would be `uploaderin:bar_foo`?\n\nAnd just to invent a usage that feels \"real\", you might use to this to do something like `uploaderin:bugowner_issueTrackerSystem` and that would let you have approval copying behavior based on if the vote is coming from the user who is the bug owner in your issue tracker. Does that match the kind of usage you expect?",
      "revId": "c0728442cf35118cbd58cd235757e5ccf22cff44",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
