      "writtenOn": "2024-12-09T12:48:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, that\u0027s correct.\n\nRe: syntax. I didn\u0027t invent the syntax, but rather copied how it was done in ChangeQueryBuilder. I assume the intentions behind adding plugin names is to avoid collisions between different plugins and make lookup in DynamicMap easier. Though it\u0027s not the most intuitive syntax for the user.\n\nRe: example. FYI the immediate reason why we are adding this, is because we want to have `uploaderin:googler_google` for our google instance, that does checks in a manner consistent with other parts (like auth). Though your example makes sense as well.",
